'''Mulaamnir''' is a blue [[ON:Dragon|dragon]] who serves as the second-in-command to [[ON:Kaalgrontiid|Kaalgrontiid]]. He appears at the [[ON:Defense Force Outpost|Defense Force Outpost]] while burning it down and can be followed to the [[ON:Sleepy Senche Mine|Sleepy Senche Mine]]. At the mine, he will parley with you and hint at [[ON:Euraxia Tharn|Euraxia's]] plans.
