===The Battle for Riverhold===
Mulaamnir circles around [[ON:Riverhold|Riverhold]] after [[ON:Bahlokdaan|Bahlokdaan]] and Kaalgrontiid arrive.

===Two Queens===
[[File:ON-quest-Two Queens 05.jpg|thumb|right|Mulaamnir with Euraxia]]
In the [[ON:Rimmen Palace|Rimmen Palace]] Courtyard, Mulaamnir informs Euraxia of the change in plans:
:'''Euraxia Tharn''': ''"The Moon Gate you seek lies to the southwest. [[ON:Zumog Phoom|Zumog Phoom]] has the key. Now, about my request .…"''
:'''Mulaamnir''': ''"The necromancers have already agreed to serve Kaalgrontiid. You no longer interest us, Euraxia Tharn."''
:'''Euraxia Tharn''': ''"How dare you! We had a deal!"''

Mulaamnir will then fly off, leaving Euraxia to deal with you and your allies.

===Cadwell the Betrayer===
Outside [[ON:Shadow Dance Ruins|Shadow Dance Ruins]], Mulaamnir searches for you and your allies in an attempt to prevent you from reaching the [[Online:Shadow Dance Temple|Shadow Dance Temple]]. Abnur Tharn and [[ON:Zamarak|Zamarak]] stay behind to keep him away, using [[Lore:Illusion|illusion]] magic to keep him distracted.

===Jode's Core===
After he and Kaalgrontiid fly through the [[ON:Moon Gate of Anequina|Moon Gate]], Mulaamnir will try to delay your companions in the [[ON:Plane of Jode|Plane of Jode]] as you move towards the Core.
:'''Kaalgrontiid''': ''"Mulaamnir. The vermin still pester us. Devour them."''
:'''Muulamnir''': ''"As you say, my brother."''

While the [[Online: Moon-Sentinels|Moon-Sentinels]] continue to fight you, Muulamnir will taunt you and Khamira:
:'''Khamira''': ''"The Moon-Priests still guard this sacred place."''
:'''Muulamnir''': ''"The Moon-Priests worship new gods now, you insignificant morsels!"''

As you reach a narrow canyon, Muulamnir attempt a strafing run, but Tharn will warn you of the danger:
:'''Abnur Tharn : ''' ''"Avoid Mulaamnir as best you can!"''
:'''Muulamnir : ''' ''"Go no farther, vermin!"''

Afterward, Mulaamnir will continue to fly overhead until you reach the Core, and continue attacking you by spewing lightning bolts at you while you are fighting the Moon-Sentinels.

Once you reach the Core, he will put himself between you and Kaalgrontiid who is absorbing the power:
:'''Abnur Tharn : ''' ''"Kaalgrontiid is absorbing Jode's Core! As long as the moons remain aligned, the power flowing through him is unimaginable!"''
:'''Khamira''': ''"Get me to that platform, Tharn. I can separate the Moons using the altars."''
:'''Khamira''': ''"You must deal with Mulaamnir, five-claw. I will divert whatever energy I can into the Dragonhorn, but use it sparingly."''
:'''Muulamnir : ''' ''''"You dare to face me, morsel?"''
