==Notes==
* His name translates to "Strong-Serve-Hunt" in the [[Lore:Dragon Language|Dragon Language]].
* Mulaamnir was featured in a [[Lore:Meet the Character - Mulaamnir|Meet the Character]] article on the ESO website.
* Despite initially having only a brief appearance in the Halls of Colossus, lacking a speaking role or even a visible health bar, he was already listed in the files as "Mulaamnir^M".
* He shares the same model with [[ON:Sahrotnax|Sahrotnax]].